==Battleground==
*Infinite [[Zoge]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Znache]]s spawn, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Those Guys]] spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Baa Baa]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 1~10 seconds<sup>30f~300f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zigge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Pigge]]s spawn after 60 seconds<sup>1,800f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Zomboe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*Infinite [[Hippoe]]s spawn after 80 seconds<sup>2,400f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.
*4 [[Zory|Zories]] spawn after 133.33 seconds<sup>4,000f</sup>, delay 60~120 seconds<sup>1,800f~3,600f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Spam [[:Category:Zombie Killer Cats|Zombie Killer Cats]] such as [[Vaulter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Vaulter Cat]], [[Welterweight Cat (Rare Cat)|Welterweight Cat]], or [[Gardener Cat (Rare Cat)|Gardener Cat]] to win.

